<p>Attack with your offhand weapon for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">105%, 120%, 131%, 141%, 150%</acronym> damage. If the attack hits, the target is stunned for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym> turns, and you hit it with your mainhand weapon doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">105%, 120%, 131%, 141%, 150%</acronym> damage.</p><p>The stun chance increases with your Accuracy.</p>